  "name": "Question 7",
  "problem": "The coefficient of $c$ in the expression  $\\frac{a}{4}-\\frac{2b}{3}-\\frac{3c}{5}$ is{{field-1}}.",
  "worked_solution": "The expression has three terms: \n\n$$\n\\frac{a}{4}\\,,\\,-\\frac{2b}{3}\\,,\\,-\\frac{3c}{5}\n$$\n\n \n\nThe only term with the variable $c$ is $-\\frac{3c}{5},$ so $-\\frac{3}{5}$ is the coefficient of $c.$",
